{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncStream","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers17ConsentDropReportO","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ConsentDropReport","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/ConsentDropReport"},{"kind":"text","text":"> { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reports wait until they are read. A record dropped for room is reported as it is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dropped; while that report waits unread, later ones merge into it, one report counting"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them all across their timestamps. So the reports waiting unread hold at most one overflow"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"report between any two others (denials and finished trackers), however many events"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"overflow. The sequence has one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"consumer, and ends once the consent is gone."}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/dropReports"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/consent\/dropreports"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"title":"dropReports","symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dropReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS","te